    // through the midpoints of the sides of the opposite planes CF and AH,
    // their common section SU, the diameter DG, and DE, BG through U, S.
    //
    // Added, all transparent unless noted: faceless twins for the cube's
    // outline (cubeAF), the planes CF and AH (pCF, pAH) and the triangles
    // DOU, PUE, DTU, GTS; the lines the proof names (DO, PE, OU, UP, CA,
    // DB, EG, DT, TG, UT, TS, and the guide's KL, MN). DU, UE, BS, SG are
    // solid slide twins over Joyce's DE and BG, hidden at rest
    // (initiallyHidden), so the join can be drawn; DE, BG, SU and DG stay
