              highlighted: ["CA","DB"] },
            { text: "while {CA} also equals and is parallel to {EG},",
              visible: W4,
              highlighted: ["CA","EG"] },
            { text: "therefore {DB} equals and is parallel to {EG}.",
              visible: W4,
              highlighted: ["DB","EG"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "DB equal and parallel to EG", ref: "XI.9" }] },
            { text: "And the straight lines {DE} and {BG} join their ends, therefore {DE} is parallel to {BG}.",
